d_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T16:10:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040008","verified_at":"2026-10-24T19:30:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5094290-1846018067936889","game_id":"steam-5094290","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.1.124: Better Effects, More Sounds, and Enemy Fixes","summary":"I've updated the Haunted House Hellshift demo with new weapon effects, more sound cues, and fixes for a few enemies that weren't behaving as intended. Here's what's changed:- Spectral Shotgun: New orange projectiles with matching muzzle flashes and hit effects.- More sound cues: Bats now have movement, aggro, and attack sounds. The fireplace has an audible warning, and the cat statue hisses when it starts firing.- Enemy pursuit: I fixed an issue that kept the Studio Sentinel from resuming a chas","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T17:52:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936889","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5094290-1844751498232393","game_id":"steam-5094290","kind":"announcement","title":"Haunted House Hellshift joins October Steam Next Fest","summary":"We’re joining Steam Next Fest! Haunted House Hellshift will be part of Steam Next Fest from October 19–26, and the free demo is already available! It’s a fast-paced arcade shooter set in a haunted house, with a TV audience watching you fight for the exit. Expect goofy monsters, traps, and eyeballs that open doors—more spooky cartoon fun than serious horror. Play solo or bring a friend for local two-player co-op. Give the demo a try, let me know what you think, and wishlist the game if you’d like","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T1